{"id":"n62369-2-23","stage":2,"title":"가져다주다 · 带来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62369-2-23-1","ko":"죄송해요. 이번에도 또 시험에서 떨어졌어요.","zh":"对不起，这次考试我又没及格。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에도","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에도","audio":"/audio/e2060874008b97dfe97b.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에서","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에서","audio":"/audio/03bc4310d38533975076.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌어요.","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌어요","audio":"/audio/d750985f484c425ae8e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c614974d469ce4dd7d8e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62369-2-23-2","ko":"너는 늘 내게 실망만 가져다주는구나.","zh":"你总是给我带来失望啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}},{"text":"내게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내게","audio":"/audio/ced087689b947fbe376c.mp3"}},{"text":"실망만","meaning":"失望","explanation":"실망：失望；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"실망","audio":"/audio/02a452c9e80ccc955756.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14087","senseId":"1","lemma":"실망","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실망만","audio":"/audio/835c58690de9e30acb9e.mp3"}},{"text":"가져다주는구나.","meaning":"带来","explanation":"가져다주다：带来；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가져다주다","audio":"/audio/e8a9333cf52f9955f5db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62369","senseId":"2","lemma":"가져다주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져다주는구나","audio":"/audio/a9a931db00f5d0167cbf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"96a6023ce9edabaa","term":"늘","zh":"总，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3","entryId":"40481","definition":"无论什么时候都没变化，总是。","pronunciation":["늘"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"02a452c9e80ccc95","term":"실망","zh":"失望","audio":"/audio/02a452c9e80ccc955756.mp3","entryId":"14087","definition":"因不如预期而失去希望或非常伤心。","pronunciation":["실망"]},{"id":"e8a9333cf52f9955","term":"가져다주다","zh":"带来","audio":"/audio/e8a9333cf52f9955f5db.mp3","entryId":"62369","definition":"使变成某个状态或结果。","pronunciation":["가저다주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb58ff6d0b1146690de8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62369","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你总是给我带来失望啊。","对不起，这次考试我又没及格。","妈妈，要我帮您吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，这次考试我又没及格。","妈妈，要我帮您吗？","你总是给我带来失望啊。"],"answer":2}]}
